{
  "info": {
    "name": "iteration_2",
    "description": "Run the whole collection in the given order (Collection Runner) on a FRESH database: docker compose down -v, then docker compose up --build. Ids are hard-coded: users 1-3 are participants, user 4 is the organizer of directions 1 and 2, user 5 is the organizer of direction 3. The 'normal' folder creates applications 1 and 2, edits application 1 (its status becomes EDITED) and withdraws application 2, the 'errors' folder relies on that. GET /organizer/applications requires both directionId and status. Expected status is in square brackets in each name.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "normal",
      "item": [
